   <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Noise Offset is a tweak to the noise of models, Typically EDM based models like 1.X and SDXL, that allows for a larger range of color&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
  </property>
  <layout class="QFormLayout" name="formLayout_2">
